{
  "_guide": {
    "standing": "wide swing with decent knockback like a combat shovel, has projectile parry frames to shoot them back at the attacker like a baseball bat. ",
    "falling": "swing under you, bouncing yourself up if it hits any mob or terrain. ",
    "aerial": "swing under you, bouncing yourself up if it hits any mob or terrain. ",
    "sprinting": "slide for a short distance with dodge frames and the shovel stretched out in front of you, pushing the first mob you hit (using drag mechanics) with you ",
    "guard counter": "fast upward flick of the shovel that buries hit targets. At max spirit, slams back down for breaching damage and a second bury. ",
    "throw": "no pierce/bounce, embeds in terrain only. At max spirit, aoe buries on impact. ",
    "pickup": "shovel upswing that applies increased posture damage taken in an area. ",
    "draw": "vault while attacking under you. "
  },
